# Code of Conduct

## Our pledge

We want this project to be a harassment-free experience for everyone. We act and speak in ways
that keep our community open, welcoming, diverse, inclusive and healthy.

## Our standard

This project adopts the
[Contributor Covenant, version 2.1](https://www.contributor-covenant.org/version/2/1/code_of_conduct/)
as its code of conduct. The full text, including the standards of behaviour, the enforcement
responsibilities and the enforcement guidelines, applies here.

## Reporting

Report unacceptable behaviour to <conduct-contact>. All reports are reviewed promptly and fairly,
and the privacy and security of the reporter are respected.
